:"無駄に含みのある言動や芝居がかった言動が多く、素っ頓狂な発言をしては周りを驚かせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の言うことを聞かない上に積極的な性格で、物事を自分中心に進めようとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長と胸はミニマムだが態度はマキシマム。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この余のものとなれ、晃太郎！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16127"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bfb76ebf556552a371c02a5d34e949803f1106ed7f5a073f55f93425d7cf029.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/5045f679704a122e40c30094a760f8759b429afedad4d80e43832d826f0cde48.webp","width":134,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水愛","creatorId":"vndb:s416","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s416","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s416","name":"清水 愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:38925:16127:4064:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7398","characterName":"本堂 絢乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16124","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"38925"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8549"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7398"},"originalCharacterName":"本堂 絢乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Daughter of the protagonist's landlord, the two of them are naturally friends with each other."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Works part-time at her father's computer-store. She is very shy and as a result doesn't cope very well with sexual innuendo. She has a strong sense of justice but is unable to express herself much of the time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Secret identity of the hero known as \"Maiden\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7398"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【チヨダ・ヒーロー】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公